{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28628","headline":"送杜顗赴润州幕 · 杜牧","name":"送杜顗赴润州幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年才俊赴知音，丞相门栏不觉深。\n直道事人男子业，异乡加饭弟兄心。\n还须整理韦弦佩，莫独矜夸玳瑁簪。\n若去上元怀古去，谢安坟下与沈吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}